    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "Anonymous read access to the static marketing and policy pages of eridu.ai — Company, Leadership, Careers, Contact, Resources, Terms of Use and Privacy Policy — served by the WordPress core REST API.\n\nEridu publishes no developer program, no developer portal and no product API. This document is an API Evangelist derivation of the only machine-readable interface the company serves — the WordPress core REST API behind eridu.ai — captured from the provider's own live self-describing route index on 2026-08-12. It is read-only and anonymously readable; write methods exist on the same routes but require a WordPress user with an application password.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Eridu",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
  }
